<title>CANADA: Royal acquires control of Italy's Amut.</title>
<headline>Royal acquires control of Italy's Amut.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Royal Group Technologies Ltd said on Wednesday that it acquired a majority interest in Italy-based Amut S.p.A. for cash. The value of the deal was not disclosed.</p>
<p>Royal said that Amut exported almost 90 percent of its production globally, with most shipped to subsidiaries and joint ventures of Royal.</p>
<p>It said that Amut complemented Royal's in-house equipment and tool and die manufacturing capabilities.</p>
<p>The company said the acquisition would better ensure that &quot;the extrusion equipment needs and technological requirements necessary to support Royal Group's sales growth and expansion plans will be provided.&quot;</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau 416-941-8100))</p>
